<https://example.org/disease-review/modules/afo_hierarchy> a owl:Ontology ;
    dcterms:source "BioPortal API hierarchy extraction" ;
    rdfs:comment "Contains review target classes, BioPortal ancestors, direct superclass edges, and common annotations only." .

<http://purl.allotrope.org/ontologies/common#AFC_0000090> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A condition is an information content entity that is about the portion of reality under which something occurs or is valid. The condition is limited by its scope and may have preconditions. It restricts the possible realizations. [Allotrope]" .
