<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000002> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A continuant is an entity that persists, endures, or continues to exist through time while maintaining its identity. [BFO]" .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000002> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
